@NsCreativeApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5274
@clientId = 22222222-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Daftar client (halaman 1, cari "bank", urut perusahaan menurun)
GET {{NsCreativeApi_HostAddress}}/api/clients?page=1&pageSize=20&search=bank&sortBy=perusahaan&sortDir=desc
Accept: application/json

### Dropdown client
GET {{NsCreativeApi_HostAddress}}/api/clients/lookup?search=an
Accept: application/json

### Detail client
GET {{NsCreativeApi_HostAddress}}/api/clients/{{clientId}}
Accept: application/json

### Riwayat event client
GET {{NsCreativeApi_HostAddress}}/api/clients/{{clientId}}/events
Accept: application/json

### Tambah client
POST {{NsCreativeApi_HostAddress}}/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Hendra Gunawan",
  "perusahaan": "PT Karya Mandiri Sejahtera",
  "telepon": "0821-4455-6677",
  "email": "hendra@karyamandiri.id",
  "alamat": "Kawasan Industri Jababeka Blok C-7, Cikarang"
}

### Validasi gagal (400)
POST {{NsCreativeApi_HostAddress}}/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nama": "", "telepon": "12345", "email": "salah@" }

### Ubah client
PUT {{NsCreativeApi_HostAddress}}/api/clients/{{clientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Andi Wijaya",
  "perusahaan": "PT Nusantara Digital Solusi",
  "telepon": "0812-2233-4455",
  "email": "andi.wijaya@nusantaradigital.co.id",
  "alamat": "Jl. Asia Afrika No. 90, Bandung"
}

### Hapus client yang masih punya event aktif (422)
DELETE {{NsCreativeApi_HostAddress}}/api/clients/{{clientId}}
